@baseUrl = https://api.abacatepay.com/v2

# Define API key. Replace this placeholder with your actual dev key (e.g. from your local .env file).
@apiKey = YOUR_ABACATEPAY_DEV_API_KEY

### Simulate Payment
# Simulates approval of a PIX payment for a Transparent Checkout in Dev Mode.
# Replace the "id" value with the billingId (e.g. bill_...) returned when generating the payment intent.
POST {{baseUrl}}/transparents/simulate-payment
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "bill_YOUR_BILLING_ID_HERE"
}
